            </note>
            <note corresp="#d134-f2" n="2" xml:id="d134-f2-content">
                <p>January 4. No minutes of this discussion were found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d134-f3" n="3" xml:id="d134-f3-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed is a paper entitled “Scope and Methodology of the 1974
                    Study by the President’s Pay Agent and the 1979 Study by Hay of Both the
                    Department of State and AID.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d134-f4" n="4" xml:id="d134-f4-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed is a paper entitled “Comparison of Lifetime Earnings of
                    the Military, Civil Service and Foreign Service.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d134-f5" n="5" xml:id="d134-f5-content">
                <p>Not found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d134-f6" n="6" xml:id="d134-f6-content">
                <p>Attached but not printed is a paper entitled “The Hay Study and the ‛FSO–7’ Link.”</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
